          %h3#ReferencesCDT Causal Dynamical Triangulation
          %p
            On the idea of numerical
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/path+integrals"} path integrals
            over causally triangulated spacetimes as an approach to
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+gravity"} quantum gravity
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jan+Ambj%C3%B8rn"}> Jan Ambjørn
                ,
